  "description": "Erection of first-floor rear extensions across partial width of two adjoining properties, Nos. 42 and 44  Dunsmure Road ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-5d5747db-7fff-3e74-2041-cdfaf27da360&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:6pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposed first floor rear extensions, by reason of inappropriate scale, location and design, would result in an overly prominent and incongruous addition, that would be out of keeping with the character and appearance of the host buildings and wider terrace of which they form part. As such, the proposed development is contrary to policies D1 (London’s form, character, and capacity for growth), D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach), D4 (Delivering good design) of the London Plan (2021) and policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) of the Hackney Local Plan (2020) and the Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (2025).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
